    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Imagine a community where every child, regardless of gender, feels empowered to speak up in class, schools are lush with greenery, and educational innovation flourishes. This vision is becoming a reality in Lindi, Tanzania, through the Foundations for Learning (F4L) project.",
